1
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:03,920
After qualifying for the traditional tournament,

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:08,520
Tsubasa learned from Wakabayashi that Taro Misaki is currently in France.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:11,070
Having received news of his former friend,

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:13,910
Tsubasa became even more determined!

5
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:16,570
Meanwhile, hoping to become stronger,

6
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:22,040
Kojiro underwent intense training at Coach Kira's place.

7
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:28,040
The tiger has now awakened from its sleep!

8
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,420
In response to Kojiro's efforts,

9
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:34,900
Tsubasa was also working hard to master the dead leaf shot.

10
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,890
And finally, the day of the Traditional Tournament arrived.

11
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:42,730
After completing his training, Kojiro returned to his team.

12
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:44,060
However...

13
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:48,790
Hyuga, I cannot let you play in this tournament.

14
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:56,180
Unexpected events are taking place at the Traditional Tournament!

15
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:01,200
All schools have directed their attention to the first match.

16
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:05,040
The opening match of the Traditional Middle School Football Tournament

17
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:10,340
will be between Nankatsu from Shizuoka and Azumaichi from Osaka.

18
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:12,550
The match is about to begin.

19
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:19,270
Nankatsu is aiming for its first-ever third championship in history.

20
00:01:19,270 --> 00:01:24,100
And Tsubasa will captain the match, which is the first step towards achieving their goal.

21
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:27,240
Azumaichi MS defeated Naniwa MS, last year's Osaka representative,

22
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:29,360
and participated in this tournament for the first time this year.

23
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:32,690
Even though they are playing against undefeated Nankatsu, there is not the slightest tension on their faces.

24
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:39,490
Soda of Azumaichi's defense runs to apply pressure.

25
00:01:39,490 --> 00:01:41,740
Don't play this slowly!

26
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,700
There! Take this!

27
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:46,160
He sends a cross from afar!

28
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:48,000
As if I'll allow it!

29
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,750
Tsubasa catches the ball!

30
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:53,960
Well done, Tsubasa!

31
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,260
This bastard...

32
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:59,720
The ace players of both teams are burning with ambition!

