72
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:36,230
EPISODE 35:
THE POWER OF THE RAZOR EXPLODES!

73
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:37,380
Exactly.

74
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:41,070
While aiming for the third championship, I won't take this match lightly.

75
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:46,080
Whoever we face, I will do my best for each and every match.

76
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:49,350
Follow Tsubasa.

77
00:03:49,350 --> 00:03:50,000
Yes!

78
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,040
Soda is right behind him.

79
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:54,920
I won't let you be the star of this match!

80
00:03:55,940 --> 00:03:58,140
Soda keeps up with Tsubasa's pace!

81
00:03:58,140 --> 00:04:01,630
He wasn't just talking big!

82
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,470
He disappeared!

83
00:04:03,390 --> 00:04:05,190
Razor Tackle

84
00:04:05,190 --> 00:04:06,080
What?!

85
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:14,400
Soda shifted his position to get out of Tsubasa's field of vision and delivered a powerful tackle!

86
00:04:14,770 --> 00:04:16,520
Did he say Razor Tackle?

87
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:17,900
That was a very rough move!

88
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,990
Nice! Now it's our turn!

89
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:23,220
Let's go, guys!

90
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:24,200
Let's make a fast attack!

91
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:29,490
With Tsubasa, the cornerstone of Nankatsu's defense and offense, on the ground, Azumaichi MS goes on the attack!

92
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,620
I won't allow it!

93
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:33,500
There!

94
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:37,670
Azumaichi MS's first chance today!

95
00:04:37,670 --> 00:04:38,250
Gellan, over here!

96
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:39,300
Here it comes!

97
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:42,090
Ide has taken up position at Nankatsu's goal.

98
00:04:42,090 --> 00:04:44,430
Onodera is waiting for him!

99
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:46,390
What?!

100
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:47,640
Alright!

101
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:51,850
The center of the defense, Soda, is free!

102
00:04:52,850 --> 00:04:53,880
Don't let him shoot!

103
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,480
Close down his angle!

104
00:04:56,580 --> 00:04:59,320
Do you think that's enough?

105
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:02,820
Let me show you with my shot that you're wrong!

106
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:12,700
Razor Shot!

107
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:15,210
Soda takes the shot!

108
00:05:16,330 --> 00:05:17,330
Morisaki!

109
00:05:17,330 --> 00:05:18,080
You can catch it!

110
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:20,670
Morisaki jumps!

111
00:05:22,170 --> 00:05:22,840
What?!

112
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,170
Goal!

113
00:05:26,170 --> 00:05:29,600
The ball hit the net from the top right corner!

114
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,280
That's it!

115
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:34,100
We saw the power of the Razor Shot.

116
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:36,100
What?

117
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:38,100
Nankatsu conceded the first goal!

118
00:05:39,730 --> 00:05:44,740
In the 5th minute of the first half, undefeated Nankatsu conceded a goal.

119
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:48,240
The goal scorer is defender Makoto Soda.

120
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,640
That's right.

121
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:54,500
This was the Razor Shot we also saw in the finals of the Osaka Tournament!

122
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:56,660
Makoto Soda...

123
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:57,820
You fools!

124
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:59,210
You are too careless!

125
00:05:59,210 --> 00:06:03,170
The atmosphere of the Traditional Middle School Football Tournament has changed!

126
00:06:03,170 --> 00:06:06,310
In the opening match between Nankatsu and Azumaichi,

127
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:09,940
the fact that the undefeated Nankatsu conceded the first goal

128
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:14,220
has made the match quite interesting.

129
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:17,160
Guys, the match just started.

130
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:19,350
Don't panic. Just focus on the game!

131
00:06:19,350 --> 00:06:20,440
Yes!

132
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,420
Morisaki!

133
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:24,980
That kid gave the ball an incredible curve.

134
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:26,490
Be more careful next time.

135
00:06:26,490 --> 00:06:28,740
Okay, captain.

136
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:34,370
It didn't take Soda very long...

137
00:06:34,370 --> 00:06:36,620
— BAY COAST STADIUM —

138
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,620
One, two, three, four!

139
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,130
Hey, look at that.

140
00:06:40,130 --> 00:06:41,790
Hyuga is sitting on the bench.

141
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:45,260
While everyone warms up, he's sitting there by himself on the sidelines.

142
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:49,380
Wasn't he secretly training since the end of the Tokyo Tournament?

143
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:52,970
So, was the "Hyuga has disappeared" news made up?

144
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:55,220
There's Coach Kitazume!

145
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,770
Coach Kitazume!

146
00:06:56,770 --> 00:06:59,500
Can you tell us about Hyuga's situation?

147
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:03,860
Was the "disappearance" some kind of secret training?

148
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:06,740
Secret training? I haven't heard anything like that.

149
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:09,450
I have no comment about Hyuga.

150
00:07:09,450 --> 00:07:11,910
Come on! Please don't hide it.

151
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:13,910
He went through solid training, didn't he?

152
00:07:13,910 --> 00:07:15,030
Enough!

153
00:07:15,030 --> 00:07:17,330
The only thing I can say is

154
00:07:17,330 --> 00:07:20,920
I will not let Hyuga play in this tournament.

155
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,920
What?!

156
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,500
Coach...

157
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:30,760
Nankatsu started the match badly!

158
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:34,470
As usual, Tsubasa Ozora is directing the attack!

159
00:07:34,470 --> 00:07:36,470
We believe in you, Tsubasa!

160
00:07:39,140 --> 00:07:42,280
After scoring the goal, all I need to do is mark him.

161
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,060
If I do that, the match is ours.

162
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:47,980
Damn you!

163
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,740
Come on!

164
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:54,370
Despite Soda's close marking, Tsubasa was able to make a good pass.

165
00:07:54,370 --> 00:07:57,920
Every team marks Tsubasa.

166
00:07:57,920 --> 00:08:01,750
What matters is how Tsubasa and the others handle it.

167
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:02,810
Let's go!

168
00:08:02,810 --> 00:08:05,540
Let's show them that Nankatsu isn't just Tsubasa.

169
00:08:05,540 --> 00:08:06,710
Alright!

170
00:08:06,710 --> 00:08:09,630
Nankatsu is trying to break through the midfield!

171
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:11,510
As if I'll allow it!

172
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:13,970
But Azumaichi's defense is very strong.

173
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:17,100
Damn it.

174
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,770
So you'll keep marking me even when I don't have the ball.

175
00:08:19,770 --> 00:08:20,930
That's right.

176
00:08:20,930 --> 00:08:23,270
I'll follow you to the depths of hell.

177
00:08:23,850 --> 00:08:26,420
If things have come to this, let's see who's better.

178
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:28,060
I'll shake off your marking!

179
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:31,190
Hmph! You can't run faster than me!

180
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:34,700
Nankatsu continues the attack without Tsubasa.

181
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:38,030
Soda's stubborn marking from Azumaichi is working.

182
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:41,080
Bravo, Soda! Keep being as stubborn as a goat.

183
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,250
10 minutes have passed in the match.

184
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:44,250
Tsubasa!

185
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:48,340
Izawa makes a successful pass to Tsubasa.

186
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,400
A truly good opponent.

187
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:52,760
You're the first person whose one-on-one marking has challenged me this much.

188
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,980
You are as good as they say, Tsubasa Ozora.

189
00:08:54,980 --> 00:08:58,640
I used a Razor Tackle once before, but he's not letting a second one happen.

190
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:02,620
His defensive ability on the wings is quite good.

191
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:05,810
This #7... Makoto Soda.

192
00:09:05,810 --> 00:09:11,530
He's good at marking and does a good job in every area of defense.

193
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,530
I see...

194
00:09:14,530 --> 00:09:17,540
Tsubasa! You'll crush him!

195
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:19,620
We're going forward for a goal!

196
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,410
Just send a reverse cross!

197
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:22,660
I can't risk that!

198
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:24,250
I'll do it!

199
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:29,660
He stopped him!

200
00:09:29,660 --> 00:09:31,960
Soda tackled him from behind.

201
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:32,800
What?!

202
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:36,130
Foul?

203
00:09:36,130 --> 00:09:38,680
Wow, you bastard! He did it on purpose!

204
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:40,640
Yellow card!

205
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:45,750
If Soda gets another yellow card, he'll be sent off.

206
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:49,100
When I mark someone, I stop them no matter what.

207
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:51,680
Even if I commit one or two fouls.

208
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:55,660
Azumaichi MS is doing quite well in their first match of the tournament.

209
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:58,700
They are leaving no room for Tsubasa to play.

210
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:00,180
Get a grip!

211
00:10:00,180 --> 00:10:02,080
Like you did against us in the finals,

212
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,580
show them that you can play without Tsubasa!

213
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:05,850
Damn it!

214
00:10:05,850 --> 00:10:07,930
If we can't create positions with Tsubasa,

215
00:10:07,930 --> 00:10:09,540
we'll create them ourselves!

216
00:10:09,540 --> 00:10:11,640
We trust you, Shutetsu Trio!

217
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:15,130
Nankatsu's forwards, Izawa, Taki, and Kisugi,

218
00:10:15,130 --> 00:10:18,840
are running toward the goal.

219
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,010
Leave it to me!

220
00:10:20,010 --> 00:10:21,240
You fools!

221
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,260
Can't you handle those small fry?!

222
00:10:24,310 --> 00:10:25,310
No way!

223
00:10:25,310 --> 00:10:29,310
Taking advantage of Soda's carelessness, Tsubasa breaks free.

224
00:10:29,310 --> 00:10:31,640
Taki! Tsubasa is free!

225
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:32,650
Let's join him!

226
00:10:32,650 --> 00:10:33,720
Yes!

227
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:35,650
Damn it!

228
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:40,160
It hit the center defense and changed direction.

229
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:43,830
He's turning his back to the goal!

230
00:10:43,830 --> 00:10:47,360
This stance... He's going for an overhead kick!

231
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:50,620
This is my first chance. I must use it!

232
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:53,040
As if I'll let you!

233
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:57,800
Soda blocks it with an overhead kick!

234
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:00,510
You're amazing, Soda!

235
00:11:03,650 --> 00:11:04,310
Got it!

236
00:11:04,310 --> 00:11:07,060
Izawa picks up the loose ball!

237
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:09,560
Damn it! He's free!

238
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,560
Eat this!

239
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,900
Stop it, goalkeeper!

240
00:11:15,660 --> 00:11:17,280
He saved it!

241
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:20,020
A magnificent save!

242
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:22,390
Nankatsu couldn't convert the position into a goal.

243
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:23,950
Nice save, goalkeeper!

244
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:28,950
They couldn't score, but they finally made an attack worthy of Nankatsu's name.

245
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:32,200
Still, Azumaichi MS's defense is very strong.

246
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:36,460
Anyone who sees #7 Soda understands it's a defensive team.

247
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:39,030
That's right. He's the key to the team.

248
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:42,580
His blocking of Tsubasa was admirable.

249
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:45,850
Yes, you're quite right.

250
00:11:45,850 --> 00:11:48,600
Azumaichi is a defensive team.

251
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:52,050
They didn't concede a single goal in the Osaka Tournament.

252
00:11:52,050 --> 00:11:53,850
And this Makoto Soda...

253
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:58,610
In Kasai, they call him "Ace Killer Soda".

254
00:11:58,610 --> 00:12:04,780
He sticks to the opponent's ace player and tackles either the ball or the leg to stop them.

255
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:10,640
He injured our ace player. Rendered him unable to play football again.

256
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:11,790
What?!

257
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:15,540
Considering Azumaichi is leading by one goal,

258
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:18,550
I can say that the match is in their hands.

259
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:21,340
Ace Killer Soda...

260
00:12:24,090 --> 00:12:27,350
Damn it! The move he made...

261
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:31,920
Since he's constantly marked, he has to play the reverse.

262
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:36,610
If Nankatsu loses, it will be because of Tsubasa's injury.

263
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:42,490
Nankatsu couldn't score!

264
00:12:42,490 --> 00:12:44,360
The first half is over.

265
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,130
You were great, guys!

266
00:12:48,130 --> 00:12:52,040
Soda, can you keep marking Tsubasa in the second half?

267
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,790
Soda, if you're having trouble marking Tsubasa, I can send you support.

268
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:58,540
Don't worry. The match is ours.

269
00:12:59,550 --> 00:13:01,920
He injured his leg.

270
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,860
What?!

271
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:06,920
~Anime Severler~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

272
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:16,190
Okawa, what happened?

273
00:13:16,190 --> 00:13:18,940
We need you, hurry up.

274
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:20,440
INFIRMARY

275
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,190
Tsubasa!

276
00:13:24,190 --> 00:13:28,820
The area injured while playing against Hyuga in the finals is hurting.

277
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:32,600
I don't think it's serious, but I need you to bandage it.

278
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,700
Quickly, please.

279
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,460
Okay.

280
00:13:35,460 --> 00:13:40,950
Didn't you skip the second year's spring practice because of this injury?

281
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:45,340
Yes. We handled it by getting it bandaged.

282
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:49,160
Manabu, don't mention this to anyone.

283
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:52,100
There's still the second half, and I don't want anyone to worry.

284
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:54,100
I understand.

285
00:14:00,810 --> 00:14:02,610
Yes. Done.

286
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:03,440
Thanks.

287
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,970
Are you okay?

288
00:14:07,970 --> 00:14:10,490
Yes. I will win. I promise.

289
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,230
Alright!

290
00:14:14,230 --> 00:14:18,480
If Tsubasa Ozora is injured, we need to deal with the other three!

291
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,580
Kisugi, Izawa, and Taki.

292
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:23,460
Get into one-on-one battles when they approach the goal.

293
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:24,560
Okay, Coach!

294
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:28,580
Alright! Let's keep this up and beat Nankatsu.

295
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:30,890
If there's an opportunity, go for a counter-attack.

296
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:31,720
Yes!

297
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:36,200
No problem. We can equalize the match in the second half.

298
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:39,350
Yes. We can turn the match around.

299
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:41,160
Just don't rush.

300
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:43,860
Play the way you always do and win!

301
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:44,940
Okay, Coach!

302
00:14:45,410 --> 00:14:47,380
Where is Tsubasa?

303
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:50,880
Were you in the toilet?

304
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:53,370
Yes. I'm better now.

305
00:14:53,370 --> 00:14:56,020
Let's go, guys! Let's fight in the second half!

306
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:57,370
Yes!

307
00:14:59,370 --> 00:15:01,000
We trust you, Nankatsu!

308
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,960
First, tie the score!

309
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:06,210
Hooray, hooray, Azumaichi MS!

310
00:15:06,210 --> 00:15:08,380
Where were you, Sanae?

311
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:09,970
I had a small errand to run.

312
00:15:10,970 --> 00:15:12,970
The second half begins!

313
00:15:15,980 --> 00:15:18,390
Nankatsu makes a quick start.

314
00:15:18,820 --> 00:15:20,230
Run, Tsubasa!

315
00:15:20,230 --> 00:15:22,860
Azumaichi MS seems completely unshaken.

316
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:26,570
If Nankatsu pushes forward now, they might be hit with a counter-attack.

317
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:32,070
Soda is still marking Tsubasa!

318
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:33,820
What's wrong, Tsubasa?

319
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:36,590
Won't you try to break my marking?

320
00:15:36,590 --> 00:15:39,080
I guess you can't run with those legs.

321
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:41,620
He knows about my leg...

322
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:44,590
If you won't come to me, I'll come to you!

323
00:15:47,130 --> 00:15:47,980
Tsubasa!

324
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:50,980
Nankatsu makes an incredible wall pass.

325
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:51,840
Damn it!

326
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:55,300
However, Soda doesn't give up and continues his marking.

327
00:15:55,300 --> 00:16:00,620
I can't stay free for long. I have to cross.

328
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:07,070
Is Azumaichi MS trying to prevent this goal?

329
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:11,570
Tsubasa can't pass, and Soda is right behind him!

330
00:16:11,570 --> 00:16:14,570
Damn it! I have to try!

331
00:16:14,570 --> 00:16:18,410
Tsubasa is going to shoot!

332
00:16:18,410 --> 00:16:19,160
What?!

333
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:21,850
Roberto, I challenge you!

334
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:23,210
I won't let you!

335
00:16:28,710 --> 00:16:34,510
Dead Leaf Shot!

336
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:36,900
Soda couldn't tackle in time!

337
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:38,970
Tsubasa attempts a long-distance shot!

338
00:16:38,970 --> 00:16:42,480
I couldn't catch up! He hit it too fast!

339
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:48,150
But the ball went up in the air! Looks like it's going out...

340
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:54,560
Ah! The ball suddenly dipped!

341
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:57,280
He must have put a very good spin on it!

342
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:59,530
Come on, be a goal!

343
00:17:03,910 --> 00:17:05,040
Goalkeeper!

344
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:06,170
What?!

345
00:17:09,900 --> 00:17:13,050
And goal! The goalkeeper was frozen!

346
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:15,180
Super!

347
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:21,680
No, our mistake! The ball landed on top of the net!

348
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,100
Come on!

349
00:17:23,100 --> 00:17:26,020
So close!

350
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:27,770
This is incredible!

351
00:17:27,770 --> 00:17:30,230
It landed right on top of the net!

352
00:17:30,230 --> 00:17:33,980
Sorry, Roberto. I still haven't managed it.

353
00:17:33,980 --> 00:17:37,510
I still haven't mastered this shot.

354
00:17:37,510 --> 00:17:42,370
Also, this shot strained my leg more than I expected.

355
00:17:42,370 --> 00:17:45,290
I can't attempt this shot any more!

356
00:17:45,290 --> 00:17:48,040
Damn it! You scared me!

357
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:51,960
The dead leaf shot? I was thinking of that shot too.

358
00:17:57,260 --> 00:18:01,400
But it's very difficult to put spin on the ball.

359
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:10,380
That's why I perfected my Razor Shot instead.

360
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:17,530
Even for you, Tsubasa... At this age, the dead leaf shot is impossible.

361
00:18:17,530 --> 00:18:20,780
Azumaichi MS takes the goal kick.

362
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:23,580
Alright! If there's a position, we'll attack!

363
00:18:23,580 --> 00:18:24,540
Go!

364
00:18:26,540 --> 00:18:30,260
I'm sure that last shot put a lot of strain on you.

365
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:33,670
You won't escape my marking anymore, Tsubasa Ozora!

366
00:18:33,670 --> 00:18:36,300
The 7th minute of the second half has already passed.

367
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:42,300
They're just passing the ball around!

368
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:46,220
We have no intention of attacking!

369
00:18:47,430 --> 00:18:48,770
Damn you!

370
00:18:48,770 --> 00:18:51,740
Very good. Provoke the opponent.

371
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:53,910
We must be careful of Tsubasa's shots.

372
00:18:53,910 --> 00:18:58,150
If Soda can hold him for about 20 minutes, we'll win.

373
00:18:58,730 --> 00:19:00,460
Don't rush.

374
00:19:00,460 --> 00:19:04,160
If you attack, come back quickly.

375
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:06,660
I really don't like this atmosphere.

376
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:09,210
Tsubasa is completely marked.

377
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:11,920
The match is ending!

378
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:14,800
It could end with a sad result...

379
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:19,820
We've passed the 20-minute mark of the second half where Nankatsu found no positions.

380
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:21,720
Damn it! Only 10 minutes left.

381
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:24,470
Damn it!

382
00:19:25,490 --> 00:19:28,520
Izawa stole the ball with a tackle!

383
00:19:29,910 --> 00:19:33,860
Soda's marking on Tsubasa makes it impossible for Tsubasa to pass.

384
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:38,610
It doesn't matter that Soda is marking Tsubasa!

385
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:40,440
Even if there's no time left,

386
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,490
we still trust Tsubasa!

387
00:19:44,110 --> 00:19:47,160
Even though he's marked, Nankatsu passes to Tsubasa.

388
00:19:47,990 --> 00:19:50,540
You can't escape me, Tsubasa!

389
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,790
Catch me, Soda!

390
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,920
Tsubasa runs directly towards his opponent!

391
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:00,970
He slips between them just before the collision!

392
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:02,800
Alright!

393
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:05,680
Nankatsu has found a position after a long time!

394
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:09,720
Tsubasa needs to cross.

395
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,810
Tsubasa, you bastard...!

396
00:20:11,810 --> 00:20:17,070
But Kisugi, Izawa, and Taki across the goal are marked.

397
00:20:18,390 --> 00:20:21,450
Ah! Nankatsu still has an unmarked player!

398
00:20:21,450 --> 00:20:22,320
Nagano!

399
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:23,700
Come on, Tsubasa!

400
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:25,660
I'll mark him!

401
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:29,240
Tsubasa can't pass to anyone!

402
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,170
What are you doing, Tsubasa?

403
00:20:31,170 --> 00:20:33,290
You're free! Run yourself!

404
00:20:33,290 --> 00:20:35,290
Alright!

405
00:20:35,290 --> 00:20:37,670
Tsubasa crosses!

406
00:20:37,670 --> 00:20:39,700
If the ball comes from the air, it's ours.

407
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:41,940
Everyone try to clear the ball!

408
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:42,550
Yes!

409
00:20:43,930 --> 00:20:48,240
Ah! Tsubasa passed the ball to the center of defense, Takasugi!

410
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,180
What?!

411
00:20:49,180 --> 00:20:51,180
Take this!

412
00:20:51,180 --> 00:20:53,560
He's making a header!

413
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:55,760
Ah!

414
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:59,820
And goal! Nankatsu tied the score!

415
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:01,570
I did it!

416
00:21:01,570 --> 00:21:04,320
Woah! Nice header, Takasugi!

417
00:21:05,520 --> 00:21:06,870
Nice run!

418
00:21:07,430 --> 00:21:10,460
You bastard! You scored before me!

419
00:21:10,460 --> 00:21:12,370
That was supposed to be a joke!

420
00:21:12,370 --> 00:21:17,380
Nankatsu scored with Takasugi!

421
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:21,550
Thanks to Tsubasa's attention, Takasugi scored.

422
00:21:21,550 --> 00:21:22,670
Damn it!

423
00:21:22,670 --> 00:21:25,300
If it's tied, the match is ours!

424
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:28,750
Tsubasa, is your leg okay?

425
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,430
We defenders are like goalkeepers.

426
00:21:32,430 --> 00:21:35,390
We watch the moves from behind.

427
00:21:36,050 --> 00:21:40,020
Takasugi! I'm fine. Nothing to worry about.

428
00:21:40,020 --> 00:21:41,850
Really?

429
00:21:41,850 --> 00:21:46,610
Tsubasa! Did you not go yourself because of your leg?

430
00:21:46,610 --> 00:21:49,870
Phew! I'm relieved.

431
00:21:49,870 --> 00:21:52,330
Nankatsu will go on a streak after this.

432
00:21:52,330 --> 00:21:54,160
I guess so.

433
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:56,140
Damn it! It's tied.

434
00:21:56,140 --> 00:21:58,120
We just needed to hold on a little longer.

435
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:01,040
I fell for your game, Tsubasa Ozora.

436
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,760
Don't worry, guys!

437
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:06,840
I'll turn the game around with my Razor Shot.

438
00:22:07,270 --> 00:22:12,140
But Soda, they'll be more prepared this time.

439
00:22:12,140 --> 00:22:17,100
No problem. The Razor Shot works every time!

440
